    <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A region at which only abstract qualities can be directly located. It assumes some metrics for abstract (neither physical nor temporal) properties.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
