    <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">This is the immediate relation between roles and endurants. A role classifies the position (function, use, relevance, ...) of an endurant within a context (description). Roles can be ordered, interdependent, at different layers. etc.</rdfs:comment>
